01:06:16.915 --> 01:06:18.275
Thanks again.

01:06:18.675 --> 01:06:21.555
Have a great rest of the year. Welcome, Jan. Thanks.

01:06:22.675 --> 01:06:24.355
Thanks. I'll talk to you soon. Bye.
